  <div class="body-grid "><main><section class='memory-tree'><span class='eyebrow'>DM / MEMORY TREE</span><h2>Memory Tree</h2><p class='mt-links'><a href='/dm/c-100-0'>Return to DM</a> · <a href='/?view=providers'>Memory Tree model and window settings</a> · <a href='/dm/c-100-0/compaction/read'>Read retained evidence</a></p><p class='mt-stats'>4 entries · 0 summary blocks · 0 pending · 4 verbatim · compactor off </p><div class='mt-legend' aria-label='Legend'><span><i class='mt-sw mt-sw-sum'></i>Summary</span><span><i class='mt-sw mt-sw-rev'></i>Operator revision</span><span><i class='mt-sw mt-sw-pending'></i>Not summarised yet</span><span><i class='mt-sw mt-sw-entry'></i>Verbatim entry</span><span><i class='mt-sw mt-sw-pin'></i>Pinned</span><span><i class='mt-sw mt-sw-drop'></i>Dropped from agent view</span></div><div class='mt-visual' tabindex='0' role='region' aria-label='Memory Tree diagram; scroll horizontally on small screens'><svg class='mt-svg' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1000 250' role='img' aria-labelledby='mt-title'><title id='mt-title'>Memory Tree: 4 blocks covering 4 entries</title><text x='20' y='22' class='mt-label'>SELECTED HISTORY · WHAT THE NEXT TURN STARTS FROM</text><path class='mt-fan mt-fan-entry' d='M20.0 104 L256.2 104 L260.0 166 L20.0 166 Z'/><a href='/dm/c-100-0/memory/node?entry=0' target='memory-detail'><title>Entry 0 · verbatim</title><rect class='mt-entry' x='20.0' y='36' width='236.2' height='68' rx='5'/><text x='138.1' y='75' class='mt-text' text-anchor='middle'>0</text></a><rect class='mt-seg-entry' x='20.0' y='166' width='240.0' height='14'/><path class='mt-fan mt-fan-entry' d='M261.2 104 L497.5 104 L500.0 166 L260.0 166 Z'/><a href='/dm/c-100-0/memory/node?entry=1' target='memory-detail'><title>Entry 1 · verbatim</title><rect class='mt-entry' x='261.2' y='36' width='236.2' height='68' rx='5'/><text x='379.4' y='75' class='mt-text' text-anchor='middle'>1</text></a><rect class='mt-seg-entry' x='260.0' y='166' width='240.0' height='14'/><path class='mt-fan mt-fan-entry' d='M502.5 104 L738.8 104 L740.0 166 L500.0 166 Z'/><a href='/dm/c-100-0/memory/node?entry=2' target='memory-detail'><title>Entry 2 · verbatim</title><rect class='mt-entry' x='502.5' y='36' width='236.2' height='68' rx='5'/><text x='620.6' y='75' class='mt-text' text-anchor='middle'>2</text></a><rect class='mt-seg-entry' x='500.0' y='166' width='240.0' height='14'/><path class='mt-fan mt-fan-entry' d='M743.8 104 L980.0 104 L980.0 166 L740.0 166 Z'/><a href='/dm/c-100-0/memory/node?entry=3' target='memory-detail'><title>Entry 3 · verbatim</title><rect class='mt-entry' x='743.8' y='36' width='236.2' height='68' rx='5'/><text x='861.9' y='75' class='mt-text' text-anchor='middle'>3</text></a><rect class='mt-seg-entry' x='740.0' y='166' width='240.0' height='14'/><text x='20.0' y='200' class='mt-small' text-anchor='start'>0</text><text x='260.0' y='200' class='mt-small' text-anchor='middle'>1</text><text x='500.0' y='200' class='mt-small' text-anchor='middle'>2</text><text x='740.0' y='200' class='mt-small' text-anchor='middle'>3</text><text x='980.0' y='200' class='mt-small' text-anchor='end'>4</text><text x='20' y='232' class='mt-label'>RETAINED JOURNAL · 4 ENTRIES · LINEAR POSITIONS →</text></svg></div><p class='mt-hint'>Older history folds into aligned summary blocks (level L covers 2<sup>L</sup> entries); recent entries stay verbatim. Select a block to expand its children, summary, versions and source; regenerate with an emphasis, pin or drop entries there. Ranges are zero-based and end-exclusive. Summaries are untrusted evidence; the original journal is never rewritten.</p><iframe class='mt-detail' name='memory-detail' title='Memory Tree block detail' src='/dm/c-100-0/memory/node?block=0.1'></iframe><details class='mt-meta'><summary>Raw Memory Tree metadata</summary><pre>{
